<title>USA: Suffolk Bancorp Q4 shr rises.</title>
<headline>Suffolk Bancorp Q4 shr rises.</headline>
<dateline>RIVERHEAD, N.Y. 1997-01-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr			  $0.87		    $0.60</p>
<p> Net			  2,877		    2,181</p>
<p> Avg shrs		   3,299		    3,662</p>
<p>		 Year</p>
<p> Shr			  $3.19		    $2.43</p>
<p> Net			 10,647		    9,089</p>
<p> Avg shrs		   3,341		    3,739</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE - Provision for possible loan losses at Q4 1996 was $300,000 vs Q4 1995 $150,000</p>
<p>Total assets at December 1996 were $804.4 million versus $805.8 million.</p>
<p>((-- New York newsdesk 212-859-1610))</p>
